      "cooked": "<p>so just saw the trailer for this new series that combines people from The Flash and Arrow. Looks so good. Still trying to figure out why only half of Firestorm is present at the meeting of heroes, but Firestorm is seen running around. Also like the new hero: White Canary. That must get confusing at battles for bad guys. Get the canary... Which one boss they both are kicking our butt.</p><p>Plus looks like they will be traveling through time maybe?</p><p>And Vandal Savage is the bad guy, which should be interesting. Which makes me think, does Sentinels need a villian that can live forever and manipulate things like Savage or is Haka running around enough on the immortal front?</p>",
